                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This program has amazing potential, but as of today, it is fairly disappointing.  The programmed portion is informative, but I wanted to move around and zoom and rotate, but that is not possible.  The final view of all of the known galaxies is amazing, but it is static: you cannot explore it, move through it, rotate it, zoom in and out.  Frustrating.  And the Explore portion is buggy and very limited.\n\nI can see this as an amazing program some day.  Just not today.  Frustrating.",
